 # 3 STELLIG | AB 100 

 ䷁ ䷗ Jump   ䷁ ䷗ Jump   ䷁ ䷗ Jump
 ⠁⠀⠀ 100    ⠂⠀⠀ 200    ⠄⠀⠀ 300
 ⠁⠀⠁ 101    ⠂⠀⠁ 201    ⠄⠀⠁ 301
